    IDS_CLEANUP_SERVICE_PAUSE_FAILED "NVIDIA LocalSystem Container could not be paused, so NVIDIA App cache items were not cleaned.\n\n"
    IDS_CLEANUP_NO_CHANGES "No files needed to be removed."
    IDS_MAIN_HEADING "Storage cleanup"
    IDS_MAIN_DESCRIPTION "Review found files before cleaning. Rollback, Installer2, and NGX items stay optional."
